      "body": "The usual plan is the first, more prominent button; the busy-day option is a secondary button beneath it. Neither is recorded until you tap one. So they aren't visually equal, even though both let you record the action you did. That's a useful distinction to check. I'll ask what people expect to see in their history before they tap, without suggesting 'completed' or 'missed' in the question. Thanks for pointing that out."
